1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,038
How it works: research tools draft, but never touch keys.

2
00:00:04,038 --> 00:00:10,395
A named person approves every valuation, new share and dividend, and no one can approve their own request.

3
00:00:10,395 --> 00:00:14,014
Only then is it written to the chain, where anyone can check it.

4
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:21,073
It runs on any EVM chain, layer one or layer two: today BlockID Chain, Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

